 to which its modulations are referred, and with which it generally begins and ends; keynote. ; Fig: The general pitch or tone of a sentence or utterance.	j:12hi,78,2;er6,61,5;nyp,59,5;fco,56,3;4zy,54,7;2b4j,53,16;nye,53,5;1l55,52,26;1jrb,50,3;sfz,47,2;em4,46,3;4zt,45,4;rfv,44,7;2b49,42,7;4j1,42,5~1l4t,36,27;1l55,52,26;2b4j,53,16;14bj,30,16;12cm,35,16;1ovy,7,15;kgd,40,11;23p6,28,10;1hsu,14,8;1int,11,8;2b49,42,7;4zy,54,7;14bn,27,7;rfv,44,7;1080,34,5
